{{Enemy Infobox|Shelled Parasite}}
'''Shelled Parasite''' is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] encountered exclusively in [[Act 2]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Shelled Parasite}}
'''Shelled Parasite''' cannot use {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Fell}} on its first turn. After that, it will use one of the following attacks each turn:
* {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Double Strike}} (40% chance)
* {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Life Suck}} (40% chance)
* {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Fell}} (20% chance)
'''Shelled Parasite''' cannot use {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Double Strike}} or {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Life Suck}} three times in a row, or {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Fell}} twice in a row. 

On {{Asc|17|Ascension}}, '''Shelled Parasite''' will always start with {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Fell}}.

If all of its {{KW|Plated Armor}} is broken, '''Shelled Parasite''' will change its current [[Intent]] to {{Int|Shelled Parasite|Stunned}}. This can only happen once per combat.

== In Party With ==
=== Act 2 ===
As an easy pool encounter:
* Solo

As a hard pool encounter alongside:
* 1 {{M|Fungi Beast}}

